**Cuando usuario hace click en "Start Analysis"**:

**Endpoint**:
POST /api/jobs

**Request body** (mismo que el de `/estimate` pero sin el `github_token` expuesto, solo una referencia si ya lo guardaste):
```json
{
  "repo_url": "https://github.com/company/api-backend",
  "branch": "main",
  "github_token": "ghp_xxxxxxxxxxxx",
  "tier": "standard",
  "agent_configs": [...]
}
```

**Response**:
```json
{
  "job_id": "uuid-1234",
  "status": "running",
  "created_at": "2024-01-15T10:30:00Z",
  "started_at": "2024-01-15T10:30:15Z",
  "repo_url": "https://github.com/company/api-backend",
  "branch": "main"
}
```

**Frontend navega a**: `/jobs/{job_id}` (Job Live View)

---

### Flujo 3: Vista en Vivo de Job (Running)

**URL**: `/jobs/{job_id}` (cuando status = running)

**Actualización en tiempo real**: SSE (Server-Sent Events) o WebSocket

**Endpoint SSE**:
GET /api/jobs/{job_id}/stream

**Eventos SSE que el backend envía**:

**Tipo 1: Job status update**
event: job_status
data: {"status": "running", "elapsed_seconds": 145}

**Tipo 2: Agent started**
event: agent_started
data: {
"agent_id": "system_mapper",
"agent_name": "System Mapper",
"started_at": "2024-01-15T10:35:30Z"
}

**Tipo 3: Agent progress**
event: agent_progress
data: {
"agent_id": "system_mapper",
"status": "running",
"progress_pct": 45,
"tokens_used": 25000,
"cost_usd": 0.35,
"current_activity": "Analyzing zone 2/5"
}

**Tipo 4: Agent output streaming** (JSON parcial)
event: agent_output_chunk
data: {
"agent_id": "system_mapper",
"chunk": "{"dominant_architecture": "layered", "patterns_detected": ["
}

**Tipo 5: Agent completed**
event: agent_completed
data: {
"agent_id": "system_mapper",
"status": "success",
"completed_at": "2024-01-15T10:43:12Z",
"duration_seconds": 462,
"tokens_used": 85230,
"cost_usd": 1.45,
"output_summary": "Detected layered architecture with 87% confidence"
}

**Tipo 6: Agent communication** (cuando pasa datos a otro)
event: agent_communication
data: {
"from_agent_id": "architecture_context_builder",
"to_agent_id": "system_mapper",
"message": "Sending ArchitectureContextPayload (87KB)",
"timestamp": "2024-01-15T10:35:29Z"
}

**Tipo 7: Job completed**
event: job_completed
data: {
"status": "completed",
"completed_at": "2024-01-15T10:48:57Z",
"total_duration_seconds": 1122,
"total_tokens": 123456,
"total_cost_usd": 2.45
}

**Tipo 8: Job failed**
event: job_failed
data: {
